              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How fast does the Unsit treadmill go?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Up to 2.0 mph, which iMovR describes as deliberate for walking while working. iMovR's page gives a starting speed of 0.3 mph in one place and 0.1 mph in another. There is no incline. It is a desk walking machine, not an exercise treadmill.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is the Unsit treadmill quiet?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
