        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Buy the Unsit with a Lander if you will walk at your desk for hours
            every working day and want the widest, most solidly built under-desk treadmill we cover.</strong>
            Its 30 by 40-inch belt, 5-inch step-up, weight sensors and steel frame suit long, slow office
            walking, and iMovR's compatibility table takes the guesswork out of the desk. Get the weight
            limit, the warranty and the desk height for your configuration in writing first.
          </p>
